OL,3,GNEWSAFather admits angrily flinging
OL,4,Ababy son on floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father has admitted that he "flung"
OL,7,Fhis baby son on the floor of their west
OL,8,FLondon family home in a fit of anger,
OL,9,Fallegedly causing injuries from which
OL,10,Fhe died 14 years later.
OL,12,FLejaune Wood, 43, of Wuppertal,
OL,13,FGermany, told the Old Bailey on
OL,14,FWednesday that he was "furious" and
OL,15,Fwanted "attention" from his wife
OL,16,FPaquita but did not intend to seriously
OL,17,Fhurt four-month-old LJ on 12 December
OL,18,F2007.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
