OL,3,GNEWSAFather admits angrily flinging
OL,4,Ababy son on floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FWood also admitted it was his idea to
OL,7,Fwait for two days before his wife took
OL,8,FLJ to hospital with a broken arm and
OL,9,Fribs, a fractured skull and bleeding on
OL,10,Fthe brain.
OL,12,FLJ died aged 14 on 6 December 2021
OL,13,Fallegedly from complications linked to
OL,14,Fthe assault. Wood was charged with his
OL,15,Fmurder, which he denies.
